   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Acid dehydration of sugar. A beaker of sugar after the addition of concentrated sulphuric acid. The acid dehydrates the sugar, forming a 'pillar' of carbon (black) and steam (vapour rising). Third in a series of four pictures.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
